values.content:
Design a sales territory plan.

Company: {{ $json.companyName }}
Product: {{ $json.productDescription || 'not provided' }}
Rep count: {{ $json.repCount }}
Total quota: {{ $json.totalQuota ? $json.currency + $json.totalQuota : 'not specified' }}
Planning goal: {{ $json.planningGoal.replace(/_/g,' ') }}

Total accounts/market:
{{ $json.totalAccountsOrMarket }}

Segmentation criteria:
{{ $json.segmentationCriteria.join('\n') || 'not specified' }}

Reps:
{{ $json.reps.map(r=>r.name+(r.region?' ('+r.region+')':'')+(r.strengths?' — '+r.strengths:'')+(r.currentAccounts?' | '+r.currentAccounts+' accounts':'')+(r.quota?' | quota: '+$json.currency+r.quota:'')).join('\n') }}

Existing territories:
{{ $json.existingTerritories || 'greenfield — no existing territories' }}

Known challenges:
{{ $json.knownChallenges || 'none specified' }}

Return JSON:
{"territory_strategy":"2-3 sentences on the overall approach and rationale","territories":[{"rep_name":"","territory_name":"","segments_owned":["account segments, verticals, or regions this rep owns"],"account_count_estimate":"rough estimate","estimated_quota_share":"percent of total quota","why_this_match":"specific reason this rep suits this territory","priority_accounts":["types of accounts to prioritize first"],"potential_conflicts":["overlap or conflict risks to watch"]}],"coverage_gaps":["segments or geographies not clearly owned by any rep"],"quota_allocation":[{"rep_name":"","suggested_quota":"","rationale":""}],"ramp_notes":"any notes on new reps or territory transitions","90_day_actions":["specific actions in first 90 days to activate this plan"]}
